  "id": "https://samsm.ch/ny-architecture/",
  "type": "Article",
  "name": "Photo Series: New York Architecture",
  "summary": "\u003cp\u003eJust 15 months after I posted my \u003ca href=\"/singaporean-architecture/\"\u003eSingapore Architecture photo\nseries\u003c/a\u003e, I have decided to revisit this theme with\nsome photos I took in New York last September. Despite what this series might\nsuggest, I did explore beyond Manhattan but not as much because I found\nManhattan to be the most interesting photographically.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"diptych\"\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/14510/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/14510/14510.avif\"\n         title=\"New York Architecture 01\"\n         alt=\"Black \u0026amp; white photo of a brick apartment building behind a row of trees\"\n\t\t height=\"1000\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"14510\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/14507/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/14507/14507.avif\"\n         title=\"Chatham Green\"\n         alt=\"Black \u0026amp; white photo of a wide modernist apartment block with a tall windowless tower in the centre\"\n\t\t height=\"999\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"14507\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\u003c/div\u003e",
  "content": "\u003cp\u003eJust 15 months after I posted my \u003ca href=\"/singaporean-architecture/\"\u003eSingapore Architecture photo\nseries\u003c/a\u003e, I have decided to revisit this theme with\nsome photos I took in New York last September. Despite what this series might\nsuggest, I did explore beyond Manhattan but not as much because I found\nManhattan to be the most interesting photographically.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"diptych\"\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/14510/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/14510/14510.avif\"\n         title=\"New York Architecture 01\"\n         alt=\"Black \u0026amp; white photo of a brick apartment building behind a row of trees\"\n\t\t height=\"1000\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"14510\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/14507/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/14507/14507.avif\"\n         title=\"Chatham Green\"\n         alt=\"Black \u0026amp; white photo of a wide modernist apartment block with a tall windowless tower in the centre\"\n\t\t height=\"999\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"14507\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/14401/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/14401/14401.avif\"\n         title=\"New York Architecture 03\"\n         alt=\"Black \u0026amp; white photo looking up at 5 New York City skyscrapers\"\n\t\t height=\"1000\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"14401\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/14403/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/14403/14403.avif\"\n         title=\"New York Architecture 04\"\n         alt=\"Black \u0026amp; white photo looking up at 5 New York City skyscrapers\"\n\t\t height=\"1000\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"14403\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/14409/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/14409/14409.avif\"\n         title=\"New York Architecture 05\"\n         alt=\"Black \u0026amp; white photo looking up at 6 New York City skyscrapers\"\n\t\t height=\"1000\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"14409\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/14502/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/14502/14502.avif\"\n         title=\"New York Architecture 06\"\n         alt=\"Black \u0026amp; white photo looking up at the corner of an art deco building behind some trees\"\n\t\t height=\"1000\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"14502\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/14503/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/14503/14503.avif\"\n         title=\"New York Architecture 07\"\n         alt=\"Black \u0026amp; white photo looking up some older New York apartments, with only one behind being lit by the sun\"\n\t\t height=\"1000\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"14503\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/14412/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/14412/14412.avif\"\n         title=\"New York Architecture 08\"\n         alt=\"Black \u0026amp; white photo of a New York street corner, with more distant buildings on the left more brightly lit including their fire escapes\"\n\t\t height=\"1000\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"14412\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"diptych\"\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/14411/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/14411/14411.avif\"\n         title=\"New York Architecture 09\"\n         alt=\"Black \u0026amp; white photo looking through the bottom deck of the Queensboro Bridge at the Empire State \u0026amp; Chrysler buildings\"\n\t\t height=\"999\"\n\t\t width=\"999\"\n\t\t id=\"14411\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/14511/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/14511/14511.avif\"\n         title=\"New York Architecture 10\"\n         alt=\"Black \u0026amp; white photo from and looking through the Willamsburg bridge, with the Empire State and Chrysler buildings visible between the bridge\u0026#39;s beams\"\n\t\t height=\"1000\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"14511\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"diptych\"\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/14509/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/14509/14509.avif\"\n         title=\"Manhattan Bridge\"\n         alt=\"Black \u0026amp; white photo of the Manhattan Bridge, with the Brooklyn side pier at the centre\"\n\t\t height=\"1000\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"14509\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/14508/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/14508/14508.avif\"\n         title=\"Brooklyn Bridge\"\n         alt=\"Black \u0026amp; white photo of the Brooklyn Bridge, with the Brooklyn side pier at the centre\"\n\t\t height=\"999\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"14508\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis series was shot with my Hasselblad 500C/M and CF 150mm lens, on Ilford HP5+\nshot at EI 800 and developed in HC-110 1+49 for 11 minutes.\u003c/p\u003e",
  "url": "https://samsm.ch/ny-architecture/",
  "published": "2020-03-15T00:00:00Z",
